the Full Committee to Consider the Following:

 1) H.R. 10133, the Timely Stock Disclosure Act; 

2) H.R. 10132, the Federal Agency Performance Act; 

3) H.R. 10155, the Financial Management Risk Reduction Act;

 4) H.R. 9040, the Taxpayer Exposure Risk Reduction Act; 

5) H.R. 10062, the Freedom to Petition the Government Act; 

6) H.R. 8690, the Stop Secret Spending Act; 

7) H.R. 10151, the Modernizing Data Practices to Improve Government Act; 

8) H.R. 8706, the Dismantle DEI Act; 

9) H.R. 8753, To direct the United States Postal Service to designate single, unique ZIP Codes for certain communities, and for other purposes; 

10) Several postal naming measures.

